models/

# Working backups from earlier fixes, and the per-run error dump
data/_backup_before_*/
data/eval_errors.csv

# Everything else is tracked on purpose, so a clone runs with no setup:
#   tasks/                the working notes: lessons.md is the record of what
#                         went wrong and why, todo.md the phase log
#   db.sqlite3            the seeded database (logins, claims, flags, audit)
#   media/                receipt files uploaded through the form
#   data/receipts_images/ data/receipts_truth.csv, data/claims.csv and the rest
#                         of the synthetic corpus the project is evaluated on
#   data/eval_report.json read at request time for the landing page metrics
